contains the latest version of Sox as released from the author plus
additional bugfixes and support for playing/recording on more platforms
(including playing on recent Linux kernels).

The reason for my version is to release a collection of all known
bugfixes and improvements to Sox that will be intergated into the
authors version in the future.

This release of sox is mainly a bugfix release.  The following things
have changed since sox-11gamma-cb2:

