hfs_fs 0.8.2 is a kernel loadable module implementing the Macintosh HFS
filesystem for Linux kernel versions 2.0.1 and newer.  Note that it is
for local media only; it is not an AppleShare client.

Since the 0.8 release hfs_fs is fully read-write.

I am pleased to announce that version 0.8.2 of hfs_fs is now available
for immediate download from the HFS for Linux Page at
<http://www-sccm.Stanford.EDU/~hargrove/HFS/>.

It is also available (or soon will be) from Sunsite (and its many
mirrors) in <ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/ALPHA/hfs/>.

