INTERact BBS, accessible via telnet to sample (telnet jags.co.uk)
is available for download for free. This unlimited user system supports
a number of unique features..

Available to download from ftp://ftp.jags.co.uk/dist/interact

> What can it do?

Text based windowing system, like NONE other in this world!
Easy to configure menu system
Games server with dedicated DOS client (INTERACT.EXE)
h2h games playing to play any game
Doom/Heretic/Hexen 3+ player gaming
Full ISP capability
Powerfull FORM system
Multi-User chat facility
Plus lots more!

> Why am I doing this??

The BBS was developped for ONE reason only.  I wrote the text based
windowing system while writing a game.  Scrapped the game but couldn't
dare scrap the advanced windowing system that had been developped.  Wrote
a BBS using it and the rest is history..

> What else can I do?  I want to code and add to the system..

You are welcome.  If intrested, I can supply you with the text library
for you to write additional utilities using..  If you make changes that
we can ALL benefit with then please pass onto us for inclusion in future
releases (of which there will be many).

> We need to change the system, I think it's a code change..

Sorry, I'm not releasing the code.  It's copywrite and will be for some
time to code.  If you really really want changes made, suggest them.
Financial persuation will always work.

> How to install?

run interact.sh <directory>, Recommended install directory is /interact,
we suggest you carefully read the interact.sh script and ensure that you
are happy with the contents.  This will also extract and run a config.sh
script in the archive.  Verify this too, these scripts will make changes
to your system setup.  I can't be held responsible. 

sign on as sysop and start creating accounts...




