interface that sits between these devices and the applications requiring
access to the information stored on CD. 
It has been designed to manage from small to huge quantities of data,
especially in environments where hundreds or even thousands of CDs may be
used for archiving.
The number of drives and jukeboxes - and hence the number of CDs - that
CDFILE can manage is, in theory, unlimited. The only limitation imposed is
by the capability of the computer on which the CDFILE server is installed
to support the relevant peripherals.

