performance and reduces to a minimum the number CD manipulations.

Searching Via Indexes
CDFILE�s sophisticated indexing system allows associated searches to be
carried out without knowing the specific file name. The indexes being
stored in the local database, the searches can be executed without knowing
where the data is located.

